Generic single-database configuration for Alembic.

This directory contains Alembic migration scripts for database schema changes
in the QuantumVestAI application. It is used to track and apply database
changes over time.

To create a new migration:
    alembic revision --autogenerate -m "description of changes"

To upgrade to the latest version:
    alembic upgrade heads

To downgrade to a previous version:
    alembic downgrade <revision>

To see current revision:
    alembic current

To see revision history:
    alembic history